So I was the technical lead for this major development project

62
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:23,920
to develop a completely new warranty platform for our company.

63
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,520
This was a major project, and I was a part of that.

64
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:25,560
So I was the technical lead for this major development project to develop a completely new warranty platform for our company. This was a major project, and I was a part of that.

65
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:25,680
So I was a part of that. So I was a part of that.

66
