I worked in Denver.

72
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:44,700
We also had a group in Chicago and one in Buenos Aires.

73
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:50,680
So we had three time zones, two languages, people just getting to know each other on

74
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,860
