130
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:12,160
One of our stakeholders, senior stakeholders, the VP asked me why she should even care.

131
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:15,360
So after six months, I felt like a failure.

132
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,460
Somehow we had failed.

133
00:07:16,460 --> 00:07:17,460
I had failed.

134
00:07:17,460 --> 00:07:19,060
I didn't even know why at the time.

135
00:07:19,060 --> 00:07:20,460
I was worried and I was scared.

136
00:07:20,460 --> 00:07:24,360
Was I going to lose my job?

137
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:29,660
Even more concerning to me was this nagging thought that we were focusing mostly on the

138
00:07:29,660 --> 00:07:34,260
