148
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:16,460
call table stakes functionality.

149
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:22,160
Maybe functionality that's mission critical, but that's not market differentiating.

150
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:24,060
That is not actually moving the business forward.

151
00:08:24,060 --> 00:08:27,460
And that was certainly a trap that we'd fallen into.

152
00:08:27,460 --> 00:08:29,560
Be wary of that.

153
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:34,160
Well, it wasn't easy convincing our stakeholders, but what we decided to do was to change direction

154
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:35,660
in the new year.

155
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:42,060
To go all in and migrate our most challenging client over to this new system we were developing.

156
00:08:42,060 --> 00:08:44,060
I was terrified.

157
00:08:44,060 --> 00:08:46,860
We were going to be implementing an end-to-end solution.

158
00:08:46,860 --> 00:08:48,760
We were going to be implementing an end-to-end solution that didn't shy away from the inherent

159
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:55,960
complexity of, that was there in supporting this client.

160
00:08:55,960 --> 00:09:00,360
They had the most data and also the most complicated business processes.

161
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:04,160
So this was terrifying for me as the tech lead.

162
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:05,160
Why?

163
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:07,460
Because this new effort could not fail.

164
00:09:07,460 --> 00:09:12,360
Because if we did, we'd probably all be looking for new jobs.

165
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:14,860
Cue nervous laughter, right?

166
00:09:14,860 --> 00:09:16,660
As we move forward with this new direction.

167
