We immediately noticed an improved level of engagement from everyone on the business

168
00:09:20,860 --> 00:09:21,860
side of things.

169
00:09:21,860 --> 00:09:24,360
And that's what we were hoping for.

170
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:30,860
Conversely, if we succeeded, we'd have delivered some new capabilities that really would start

171
00:09:30,860 --> 00:09:32,760
to set us apart in the market.

172
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:34,360
And we were really excited about that.

173
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:37,860
And so was the business.

174
