00:09:50,860 --> 00:09:56,860
As I mentioned, we still had this entire iceberg of hidden complexity to deal with.

184
00:09:56,860 --> 00:10:01,860
We could see some of it above the waterline, but most of it was hidden and unknown.

185
00:10:01,860 --> 00:10:06,360
So what do you do in the face of this kind of complexity?

186
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:10,340
We dealt with a lot of the technical complexity earlier in the project, so I was less worried

